  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 601.11 “Certified” means a level of certification attained by a person as set forth pursuant to RSA 21-J:14-f and RSA 310-C. The term also includes “certification level.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 600) #10581, eff 5-1-14; ss by #13916, eff 3-28-24 (formerly Rev 601.20) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 600)",
